                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "People didn't find them visually appealing."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 22,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;In the 1960s and 1970s, engineers were unable to overcome the problem of",
                "options": [
